 Out Now! Discover the World of Classic of Mountains and Seas","summary":"Greetings, travelers of Mountains and Seas.Dinghai: The Ocean Pillar demo is available now. Here's what's included:One tutorial stage and two full stagesThree elite enemies, two stage bosses, and two hidden bossesDual-weapon system: five weapons, combinable with various Adornments and VesselsThe story of Abyssal Dragon's first encounter with Yi — and the beginning of a journey to find Yu and witness the taming of the great floodIn Dinghai: The Ocean Pillar, a world drawn from the Classic of Moun","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T08:43:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677644","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4542740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4542740":"2026-10-26T12:52:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4542740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:01Z"},"4654720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:02Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4542740","app_id":4542740,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:40Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d17dae51d4217adebde0aad4908f19caefde322049b48a5765f797862dff6d65","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"《정해》는 《